{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1774122675_9768965_47d5f95f59cd2fc3e525c372f045ef24.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><ul style=\"margin-top:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;margin-top:0.1em;margin-bottom:0.2em;\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong> Gob's Gifts is a satirical ex-Mormon brand — tees, hoodies, mugs, and tattoo designs for people who traded temple recommends for coffee and don't regret it.</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;margin-top:0.1em;margin-bottom:0.2em;\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong> We're built by and for the post-Mormon community — every product is an inside joke that only people who've been through it truly get.</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;margin-top:0.1em;margin-bottom:0.2em;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong> Share your unique link, and when someone buys through it, you earn a commission — simple as skipping church on a Sunday.</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;margin-top:0.1em;margin-bottom:0.2em;\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong> Wear it, post it, be yourself — your audience already relates to the journey, so authentic beats polished every time.</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;margin-top:0.1em;margin-bottom:0.2em;\"><strong>Other information:</strong> We regularly gift free merch to creators we vibe with, so if you're making content in the ex-Mormon space or know of others who do as well, we'd love to collab beyond just affiliate links.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
